{"id":"04f9638612cfbb2f","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-pdbfpi.md","title":"Prime implicants of a partial Boolean function","display":"df-pdbfpi — Prime implicants of a partial Boolean function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-pdbfpi","aliases":["27-df-pdbfpi"],"display":"df-pdbfpi — Prime implicants of a partial Boolean function","depends_on":["[[27-df-pdbf]]","[[27-df-term]]","[[27-df-litset]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§12.2.3, prime patterns; Lemma 12.1","source_printed_pages":"518","source_pdf_pages":"542","verification_status":"source-definition-and-proof-checked","local_review_status":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-pdbfpi"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-pdbfpi</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pdbfpi — Prime implicants of a partial Boolean function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ea846f0a3813bc0e\" href=\"?note=ea846f0a3813bc0e\" title=\"27-df-pdbf\">27-df-pdbf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e065076d6b51508e\" href=\"?note=e065076d6b51508e\" title=\"27-df-term\">27-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8311e93eaac6c631\" href=\"?note=8311e93eaac6c631\" title=\"27-df-litset\">27-df-litset</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§12.2.3, prime patterns; Lemma 12.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"518"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"542"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-and-proof-checked"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n\">\\((T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n\\)</span> (partial Boolean function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ea846f0a3813bc0e\" href=\"?note=ea846f0a3813bc0e\" title=\"27-df-pdbf\">27-df-pdbf</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_n\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e065076d6b51508e\" href=\"?note=e065076d6b51508e\" title=\"27-df-term\">27-df-term</a> 给出的项集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lits}:\\mathrm{Term}_n\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Lit}_n)\">\\(\\mathrm{Lits}:\\mathrm{Term}_n\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Lit}_n)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8311e93eaac6c631\" href=\"?note=8311e93eaac6c631\" title=\"27-df-litset\">27-df-litset</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PI}(T,F)\">\\(\\mathrm{PI}(T,F)\\)</span> (definition target)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PI}(T,F)\\coloneqq\\{U\\in\\mathrm{Term}_n\\mid(\\forall y\\in F\\;(U(y)=0))\\land(\\exists x\\in T\\;(U(x)=1))\\land\\forall\\ell\\in\\mathrm{Lits}(U)\\;\\exists y\\in F\\;(T_{\\mathrm{Lits}(U)\\setminus\\{\\ell\\}}(y)=1)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PI}(T,F)\\coloneqq\\{U\\in\\mathrm{Term}_n\\mid(\\forall y\\in F\\;(U(y)=0))\\land(\\exists x\\in T\\;(U(x)=1))\\land\\forall\\ell\\in\\mathrm{Lits}(U)\\;\\exists y\\in F\\;(T_{\\mathrm{Lits}(U)\\setminus\\{\\ell\\}}(y)=1)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>此 PI(T,F) 是书中的 prime pattern，不应与未要求覆盖正样本的任意 don’t-care implicant 混同。</li>\n<li>A listed term covers a prescribed true point, avoids every prescribed false point, and loses the latter property after deletion of any literal.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pdbf","status":"resolved","id":"ea846f0a3813bc0e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pdbf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"e065076d6b51508e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-litset","status":"resolved","id":"8311e93eaac6c631","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-litset]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pdbf","status":"resolved","id":"ea846f0a3813bc0e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n$ (partial Boolean function, see [[27-df-pdbf]])","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"e065076d6b51508e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{Term}_n$ 为 [[27-df-term]] 给出的项集，$\\mathrm{Lits}:\\mathrm{Term}_n\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Lit}_n)$ 见 [[27-df-litset]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-litset","status":"resolved","id":"8311e93eaac6c631","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{Term}_n$ 为 [[27-df-term]] 给出的项集，$\\mathrm{Lits}:\\mathrm{Term}_n\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Lit}_n)$ 见 [[27-df-litset]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"(T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Term}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lits}:\\mathrm{Term}_n\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Lit}_n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PI}(T,F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PI}(T,F)\\coloneqq\\{U\\in\\mathrm{Term}_n\\mid(\\forall y\\in F\\;(U(y)=0))\\land(\\exists x\\in T\\;(U(x)=1))\\land\\forall\\ell\\in\\mathrm{Lits}(U)\\;\\exists y\\in F\\;(T_{\\mathrm{Lits}(U)\\setminus\\{\\ell\\}}(y)=1)\\}","display":true}],"bytes":1618,"backlinks":[{"id":"5b4178d75957ed66","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$(T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n$；项、DNF 分别见 [[27-df-term]]、[[27-df-dnf]]，$\\mathrm{PI}(T,F)$ 见 [[27-df-pdbfpi]]。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-301","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-pdbfpi|df-pdbfpi — Prime implicants of a partial Boolean function]]"},{"id":"f8b61370b9b75b32","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$(T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n$；见 [[27-df-pdbfpi]]、[[27-df-pattern]]、[[27-df-extrema]]、[[27-df-piset]]、[[27-df-impset]]。"}],"outgoing":["ea846f0a3813bc0e","e065076d6b51508e","8311e93eaac6c631"]}